APPENDIX - CIRCULATED BRIEFING ITEMS

The following text is reproduced here because it was circulated with a
committee briefing and is reproduced verbatim. It is not licence text
and carries no additional permission or restriction beyond the terms
above.

Offline-First Smart Classroom Attendance & Proxy Preventer
Theme: IoT / Biometrics / Security
Difficulty: Difficult
Description: Traditional roll calls waste valuable lecture time, and manual sign-in sheets are prone to proxy attendance. Design an innovative, secure classroom attendance system that works even with intermittent internet connectivity.
Key Features: Cryptographically rotating QR codes displayed on the projector (valid for only 10 seconds), geo-fencing to ensure students are physically inside the lecture hall, and a local offline database sync mechanism for spotty Wi-Fi zones.
